Try to use string instead of dict. In that case it preserves the order:
```
from fastapi import FastAPI
from pydantic import BaseModel

class Bar(BaseModel):
    a: str
    z: str
    b: str
    
    model_config = {
        "json_schema_extra": {
            "example": """{
                "a": "x",
                "z": "x",
                "b": "x"
            }"""
            
        }
    }

app = FastAPI()

@app.get("/foo")
async def foo() -> Bar:
    return Bar(a="x", z="x", b="x")

```

